{"seq":3,"slug":"refund-inspection-link","title":"质检结论与退款联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/resale-destroy-link/refund-inspection-link","wordCount":2437,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"质检结论与退款联动\">质检结论与退款联动</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>买家在退货页面点下「已寄出」之后，心里有一个隐含的预期：钱会在某个时间点回来。而卖家侧同时推进着一条完全不同的时间线：货在集货节点攒批、在海上漂三周、在关口被查验、质检、翻新、再上架或被销毁。这两条时间线在系统里交汇于一个点——<strong>质检结论</strong>。它既是这条链路的价值判定，也应该（或者不应该）是退款的依据。</p>\n<p>这一篇讨论的正是这个交汇点的设计：质检结论如何映射到退款金额、退款与质检的时序关系如何决定资损结构、以及跨境的清关状态为什么是退款金额的一个上游依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退款金额与质检结论的三种关系\">退款金额与质检结论的三种关系</h2><p>退款金额与质检结论之间的关系，可以是三种截然不同的设计，而它们对应完全不同的客户体验与资损结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>退款金额依据</th>\n<th>退款时点</th>\n<th>客户体验</th>\n<th>卖家资损风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全额先退</td>\n<td>退货运单扫描</td>\n<td>买家寄出后立即／极早</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>最高（货可能不来、可能不符）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全额后退</td>\n<td>收货确认</td>\n<td>到仓收货后</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低（但仍有实物差异风险）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分级退款</td>\n<td>质检等级</td>\n<td>质检完成后</td>\n<td>差（等待长）</td>\n<td>最低（金额与实况匹配）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景里最现实的组合通常是<strong>第二种为主、第一种为例外</strong>：到仓收货即触发全额退款，因为跨境的质检周期太长（数周到数月），让买家等那么久不可接受；同时对低客单价、低风险品类放宽到第一种；对高客单价品类保留第三种（分级退款）以便控制损失。</p>\n<p><strong>这个选择不能只按品类，还要按市场。</strong> 不同市场对退货时效与退款时效有各自的法定要求与消费预期，把同一套时序策略套到所有市场，必然在某些市场违规、在另一些市场过度保守。以欧盟为例，《消费者权利指令》(2011/83/EU) 第 13 条要求经营者<strong>在收到消费者撤销通知后的 14 天内退还全部已收款项</strong>（含适用的配送费用），且允许经营者<strong>在收到退货或消费者提供已寄回的证明之前暂缓退款</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/13/data.xht?view=snippet&amp;wrap=true\">Article 13, Directive 2011/83/EU</a>）。这一条把上面的三种设计约束得非常具体：「全额先退」在欧盟是法定下限方向（通知后 14 天），而「暂缓至收到货」则是法律明确允许的例外窗口——<strong>分级退款若拖到质检完成之后，很可能已经越过 14 天这条线</strong>，因此分级退款在欧盟语境下必须与「先按法定要求退、后续按质检结论做调整」的机制配合使用，而不能作为唯一的退款路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"什么时候可以-先退后检\">什么时候可以「先退后检」</h3><p>「先退后检」的资损风险可以用一个期望值刻画。设先退款金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，退货实际到达且可再售的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，再售回收额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{resale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则可接受的临界条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\;&lt;\\; p \\cdot V_{resale} + (1-p) \\cdot V_{scrap} + S_{goodwill}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{goodwill}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提前退款带来的客户体验价值（复购率、评价改善），它是真实但难以精确量化的项。这个不等式的实用价值在于它把「要不要先退」变成了一个可以用数据逼近的问题：<strong>对每个品类统计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{resale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的历史分布，就能算出各品类的先退款上限</strong>。这比按固定金额阈值一刀切要准确得多——固定阈值会让高价值、高到达率、高回收率的品类被过度限制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[退货申请] --&gt; B{品类/市场策略}&#10;  B --&gt;|低风险品类| C[寄出即全额退款]&#10;  B --&gt;|高风险品类| D[到仓收货后退款]&#10;  B --&gt;|高客单价品类| E[质检后按等级退款]&#10;  C --&gt; F[退款记录&lt;br/&gt;状态:DONE]&#10;  D --&gt; G[收货核对&lt;br/&gt;见 4.1]&#10;  G --&gt; H[全额退款]&#10;  E --&gt; I[质检定级&lt;br/&gt;见 3.1]&#10;  I --&gt; J[按等级计算退款&lt;br/&gt;见下表]&#10;  J --&gt; K{清关结论&lt;br/&gt;是否已出?}&#10;  K --&gt;|未出| L[按预估退款&lt;br/&gt;差额待结算]&#10;  K --&gt;|已出| M[按确定金额退款]&#10;  L --&gt; N[清关结论到达后&lt;br/&gt;补差或冲回]\">graph TD\n  A[退货申请] --&gt; B{品类/市场策略}\n  B --&gt;|低风险品类| C[寄出即全额退款]\n  B --&gt;|高风险品类| D[到仓收货后退款]\n  B --&gt;|高客单价品类| E[质检后按等级退款]\n  C --&gt; F[退款记录&lt;br/&gt;状态:DONE]\n  D --&gt; G[收货核对&lt;br/&gt;见 4.1]\n  G --&gt; H[全额退款]\n  E --&gt; I[质检定级&lt;br/&gt;见 3.1]\n  I --&gt; J[按等级计算退款&lt;br/&gt;见下表]\n  J --&gt; K{清关结论&lt;br/&gt;是否已出?}\n  K --&gt;|未出| L[按预估退款&lt;br/&gt;差额待结算]\n  K --&gt;|已出| M[按确定金额退款]\n  L --&gt; N[清关结论到达后&lt;br/&gt;补差或冲回]</pre><h2 id=\"等级到退款金额的映射\">等级到退款金额的映射</h2><p>分级退款的映射设计有一个必须坚持的纪律：<strong>退款取到货等级（<code>as_received_grade</code>），而不是出货等级（<code>as_shipped_grade</code>）</strong>。原因很直接——退款补偿的是「买家退回时的状态」，而翻新是卖家自己的增值行为，它的收益归卖家。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>到货等级</th>\n<th>退款比例（示例口径）</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>商品完好，与买家描述一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>轻微痕迹属正常使用范围，不构成减损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>80–95%</td>\n<td>明显磨损或缺件，按残值折价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>0–50%</td>\n<td>功能异常或严重损坏，按责任判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PENDING</td>\n<td>不退款，等待</td>\n<td>判定未完成，任何金额都是猜的</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里有两处关键设计。</p>\n<p><strong>A 与 B 都退全款。</strong> 对退货场景而言，把「轻微痕迹」作为扣款理由在多数市场会被认为是过度扣减，得不偿失——扣下 10% 的钱，换来的是一个差评与一次客服介入，成本远高于收益。<strong>扣款的收益必须大于它带来的客户体验损失</strong>，这是判断是否引入 C/D 档扣款的核心标准。</p>\n<p><strong>PENDING 不退款。</strong> 这是整张表最重要的纪律：<strong>在判定未完成时给出的任何金额都是猜测，而猜测一旦出错就要走补差或冲回流程，成本远高于等待。</strong> 系统应把 PENDING 处理成一个明确的等待状态，并设一个最长期限（超期后转为默认策略），而不是让它无限期悬空。</p>\n<h3 id=\"责任判定-d-级退款的分叉\">责任判定：D 级退款的分叉</h3><p>D 级件的退款不能一刀切，因为损失责任可能在不同方之间。三种典型情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>买家责任</strong>（人为损坏、缺件）：扣减幅度可以较大，并可走争议流程。</li>\n<li><strong>商品本身缺陷</strong>：全额退款，且损失计入商品质量成本而非逆向成本，需要向上游反馈。</li>\n<li><strong>物流损坏</strong>（运输途中损坏）：全额退款，损失走承运商索赔。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三者的区分必须在质检时采集到，而不是事后推测。质检工单里需要有一个<strong>损坏归因字段</strong>（<code>damage_attribution</code>），它的取值决定了后续钱从哪个科目出、要不要发起索赔。<strong>没有这个字段，所有 D 级损失都会落到同一个成本池里，品质问题与物流问题就永远无法被定位和改善。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"清关状态作为退款的上游依赖\">清关状态作为退款的上游依赖</h2><p>这是跨境场景独有的一个约束，<a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/return-customs-doc-status\">2.3</a> 已经埋下伏笔。当退货条款里包含「相关税费由卖家承担」时，退款金额就包含了关税部分——而关税的最终金额要等清关结论才能确定。这意味着退款流程里存在一个跨境的、慢速的外部依赖。</p>\n<p>处理这个依赖有三种做法，选择取决于业务对客户体验的容忍度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>客户等待</th>\n<th>卖家风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部等清关</td>\n<td>最长</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>极少使用，体验太差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按预估退，差额结算</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>预估偏差</td>\n<td>主流做法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略关税，全额退</td>\n<td>最短</td>\n<td>关税损失自担</td>\n<td>低关税占比的市场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「按预估退、差额结算」是主流，但它的实现要求系统把退款拆成<strong>两个部分</strong>管理：一部分是不可变的、立即结算的主退款，另一部分是可变的、待结算的调整项。这与 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory\">4.1</a> 里「已归集成本 + 待归集估计」的双口径是完全同构的设计——<strong>凡是依赖慢速外部事实的金额，都要拆成即时部分与待结算部分</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;refund_id&quot;: &quot;RF-2026-0914-88213374&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rma_id&quot;: 88213374,&#10;  &quot;policy&quot;: &quot;GRADE_BASED_WITH_SLA_FLOOR&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade_as_received&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,&#10;  &quot;components&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;ITEM_PRICE&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 189.0, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;SETTLED&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;OUTBOUND_SHIPPING&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 12.5, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;SETTLED&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;DUTY_TAX&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 9.6, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;PENDING&quot;, &quot;depends_on&quot;: &quot;CUSTOMS_DECLARATION:declaration_id=7731&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;total_settled&quot;: 201.5,&#10;  &quot;total_pending&quot;: 9.6,&#10;  &quot;sla_floor_hours&quot;: 72&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"refund_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RF-2026-0914-88213374\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rma_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88213374</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GRADE_BASED_WITH_SLA_FLOOR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade_as_received\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ITEM_PRICE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">189.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SETTLED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OUTBOUND_SHIPPING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SETTLED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DUTY_TAX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PENDING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"depends_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CUSTOMS_DECLARATION:declaration_id=7731\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_settled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla_floor_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sla_floor_hours</code> 是一个重要的保护：<strong>无论内部流程多慢，对客户承诺的退款时限必须被一个独立于内部状态的兜底机制守住</strong>。它的实现方式通常是一个定时任务扫逾期未结算的退款，强制按预估金额结清并把差额记账为暂估调整。把客户的等待绑在内部流程的完成上，是这类系统最容易引发客诉的设计缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻篇的衔接\">与相邻篇的衔接</h2><p>本篇是整条链路的收口：它消费 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade\">3.1</a> 的到货等级、<a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/return-customs-doc-status\">2.3</a> 的清关结论、<a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory\">4.1</a> 的成本基准与减值、以及 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary\">4.2</a> 的处置损失；它的产出是完整的单件资损口径，而<strong>这个口径是 <a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/dispose-local-vs-return\">1.2 就地处置 vs 回运决策</a> 里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{local}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{home}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 估计的最终校准来源</strong>，也是 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3</a> 渠道容量与保留价的调整依据。整个 hub 在这里闭环。退款本身的税务冲调与关税返还凭证链不在本 hub，见 062_refund-tax-adjustment。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>退款金额与质检结论的关系有三种设计（全额先退／全额后退／分级退款），跨境场景下最现实的是「到仓收货后退为主」的混合策略，且策略必须按品类与市场分别设定。</li>\n<li>「先退后检」的临界条件可以用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; p \\cdot V_{resale} + (1-p) \\cdot V_{scrap} + S_{goodwill}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逼近，比固定金额阈值准确得多。</li>\n<li>分级退款取到货等级而非出货等级；A/B 双档退全款，因为扣款收益通常小于客户体验损失。</li>\n<li>PENDING 状态不得给出任何退款金额，并应设最长期限与默认策略。</li>\n<li>D 级损失必须采集 <code>damage_attribution</code>（买家责任／商品缺陷／物流损坏），否则品质与物流问题永远无法被定位。</li>\n<li>依赖清关等慢速外部事实的金额要拆成即时部分与待结算部分；承诺给客户的退款时限必须有独立于内部状态的兜底机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质检结论与退款联动","id":"质检结论与退款联动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"退款金额与质检结论的三种关系","id":"退款金额与质检结论的三种关系"},{"level":3,"text":"什么时候可以「先退后检」","id":"什么时候可以-先退后检"},{"level":2,"text":"等级到退款金额的映射","id":"等级到退款金额的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"责任判定：D 级退款的分叉","id":"责任判定-d-级退款的分叉"},{"level":2,"text":"清关状态作为退款的上游依赖","id":"清关状态作为退款的上游依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻篇的衔接","id":"与相邻篇的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"残次销毁/二手转售处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary"},"next":null}